{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Sala de Juegos 3D!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique collection of classic board games in an immersive 3D environment with online multiplayer. Gather your family or friends and enjoy timeless games like never before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae What's Included?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe1 <strong>Ludo (Parch\u00eds)</strong>: With dynamic lighting, realistic dice, and smooth movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc0d <strong>Snakes and Ladders</strong>: A colorful board where luck rules the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>The Goose Game</strong>: A traditional race game with fun illustrated spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u265f <strong>Classic 3D Chess</strong>: Elegant visuals and fully functional mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd2 <strong>Air Hockey</strong>: Fast-paced, competitive, and physics-based fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Pong Crostle 2</strong>: An original game by Crostle\u2019s Studios \u2014 a modern twist on the classic Pong with fresh mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf08 <strong>DoRecolors</strong>: An original game where you must follow the color shown on the marker\u2026 and only the fastest players survive! Supports up to 8 players \u2014 perfect for wild, laughter-filled matches. Features customizable characters, cannons, and countdown timers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd11 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Online multiplayer</strong> with private rooms (optional password).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd90\ufe0f <strong>Custom hand cursors</strong>: Each player controls their own &quot;hand&quot;, complete with emojis and rotation options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f <strong>Cozy 3D game room</strong> with multiple camera angles (frontal, side, etc.) for each chair or couch spot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcac <strong>Built-in chat system</strong>, with player-colored messages based on their seat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udded <strong>Free Mode</strong>: Walk around the room freely and explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Keyboard shortcuts</strong> for passing turns, playing music, or exiting the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udccb <strong>Player list</strong>, room name, FPS, and ping displayed in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Sound effects</strong> for dice rolls, chess pieces, Air Hockey, and Pong Crostle 2.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca4 <strong>AFK system</strong> that kicks inactive players to keep the experience smooth for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perfect for having fun with friends or family in a shared virtual room full of classic games and cozy vibes!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646490?t=1745572494","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646490?t=1745572494","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646490/b1a85f901ddffe395ce7349af549dfd3ce112553/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745572494","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646490/b1a85f901ddffe395ce7349af549dfd3ce112553/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745572494","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id"